  "name": {
    "ja": "SD 三国創傑伝 天覇曹操ウイングガンダム",
    "en": "SD Sangoku Soketsuden Tenha Cao Cao Wing Gundam"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 880,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2021年04月17日 (土)",
    "year": 2021,
    "month": 4,
    "day": 17
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "【2021年春、日本展開開始！！】",
      "en": "[Spring 2021, main rollout begins! ! ]"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 『三国志』をベースにしたSD ガンダムが装いも新たに登場！",
      "en": "• SD Gundam based on \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms\" now has a new look!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 進化したプロポーションとパーツ分割へのこだわりにより、組み立てただけでSD史上最高峰の色分けを実現。",
      "en": "• With advanced proportions and attention to parts division, we have achieved the highest color separation in SD history using just the assembly."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 一新された頭身バランスと各所の関節構造により、躍動感あふれるポージングを再現！",
      "en": "• The all-new head and body balance and joint structure in various parts allow for dynamic poses!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 本体に加えて武装もパワーアップ！超大型剣\"天覇双翔剣\"が付属！",
      "en": "• In addition to the main body, the weapons are also powered up! Super large sword \"Tenha Soshoken\" is included!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ギ・エリアの夏侯惇、夏侯淵、荀イク、張遼、張郃、典韋、徐晃（別売り）との合体が可能！",
      "en": "• Can be combined with Gi Area's Xiahou Dun, Xiahou Yuan, Xun Iku, Zhang Liao, Zhang He, Dian Wei, and Xu Huang (sold separately)!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 背中のスロットにはメモリを8枚装備可能！",
      "en": "• You can install 8 pieces of memory in the slot on the back!"
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "天覇双翔剣×1",
      "en": "Tenha Sosho Sword x1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "メモリ×1",
      "en": "Memory x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ホイルシール×1",
